---
description: All commits on this repository must be authored as Nova-DevBot
alwaysApply: true
---

Every commit you create in this repository must be authored as the project bot:

- `GIT_AUTHOR_NAME=Nova-DevBot` (exactly this name)
- `GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL=dev@novacognitive.com` **or**
  `GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL=298337751+Nova-DevBot@users.noreply.github.com`

Never commit under a personal human identity on this repository. The committer may be
GitHub when a pull request is merged; the author is what matters.

Before committing, make sure the identity is set:

```bash
git config user.name  "Nova-DevBot"
git config user.email "dev@novacognitive.com"
```

CI (`.github/workflows/commit-identity.yml`) rejects any introduced commit whose author
name or email is outside that allowlist. See `AGENTS.md` for the full rule.
